Author: Dr. Thorsten Tepper Garcia

Created: 12 MAY 2020

About:

This subdirectory contains a number of patches
to files originally in amr, unless stated otherwise.

units.f90:
- added km2cm conversion factor from amr/constants.f90
- added scale_m (type real(db))
- automatically set scale_t when poisson=.true. to
	ensure that G=1 in user units for all gravity runs
- provide information to stdout about relevant units

amr_parameters.f90:
- added output parameter 'output_dir' (type character(len=80))
	which allows to redirect the output to any location

output_amr.f90:
- added TRIM(output_dir) to filename strings where relevant; this should
	propagate through all the output routines via the 'filename'
	variable
- added output sink***csv

init_amr.f90:
- added TRIM(output_dir) to filename strings where relevant

movie.f90:
- added TRIM(output_dir) to filename strings where relevant; this should
	propagate through all the output routines via the 'filename'
	variable
